### Registration
POST http://localhost:3001/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "myadmin",
  "password": "myadmin",  
  "email": "myadmin@gmail.com",
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "Admin",
  "typeId": 2
}

###

### Login
POST http://localhost:3001/session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mario.rossi",
  "password": "mariorossi"
}

###

### Get current user
GET http://localhost:3001/session/current

###

### Create a new Report
POST http://localhost:3001/reports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Lampione rotto
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Il lampione davanti alla scuola non funziona
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="latitude"

45.12345
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="longitude"

12.54321
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address"

Via Roma 1, Milano
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

1
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="catId"

1
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="createdAt"

2025-11-07T18:30:00.000Z
--MyBoundary--

###

### Update user profile with photo
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/user/profile
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="telegramUsername"

@mario_rossi
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="allowEmailNotification"

1
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profilePhoto"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /Users/auroragennaro/Downloads/huge-join.png
--MyBoundary--

###

### Verify profile photo in database
GET http://localhost:3001/session/current

###

### Update profile without photo (only telegram and notifications)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/user/profile
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="telegramUsername"

@mario_updated
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="allowEmailNotification"

0
--MyBoundary--

###

### Update profile with new photo (should delete old one)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/user/profile
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="telegramUsername"

@mario_rossi
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="allowEmailNotification"

1
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profilePhoto"; filename="new-profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /Users/auroragennaro/Downloads/huge-join.png
--MyBoundary--

###

### Delete profile photo
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/user/profile/photo

